# Real source documents live in this directory and are NEVER committed.
#
# They are working-reference documents from the actual process: sensitivity-labelled
# at source, carrying legal entities, cost centers, CAGE codes, site locations, and
# CAS/FAR disclosure classifications. The repository's root .gitignore already excludes
# them by extension; this file ignores the directory's contents outright, so a new file
# type dropped here is covered without anyone remembering to add a pattern.
#
# Anything the repo needs from these is transcribed by hand, genericised, and reviewed
# before it goes anywhere near a commit. See CLAUDE.md, "Data handling".
#
# A force-push does not remove published history. If one of these is ever committed,
# deleting and recreating the repository is the only reliable fix.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
